OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after gun fired in
OL,4,Astreet
OL,5,
OL,6,FWitnesses have been asked by police to
OL,7,Fcome forward after reports of a gun
OL,8,Fbeing fired on a residential street in
OL,9,FDoncaster.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Gordon Road in
OL,12,FEdlington at about 22:15 BST on Friday
OL,13,Fand evidence consistent with a firearms
OL,14,Fdischarge was found, according to South
OL,15,FYorkshire Police.
OL,17,FNo one was injured during the incident
OL,18,Fand a cordon remained in place on
OL,19,FMonday, with officers working "at pace"
OL,20,Fto investigate the incident, a force
OL,21,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
