OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after gun fired in
OL,4,Astreet
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Tom Woodward said: "There
OL,7,Fwill be additional patrols in the area
OL,8,Fto ensure the community is safe and
OL,9,Fplease do speak to officers if you see
OL,10,Fthem and have any concerns or
OL,11,Fquestions."
